{
    "0": {
        "60_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Nothing interesting happening around here.",
            ]
        },
        "61_0": {
            "lines": [
                "And I have been here only for less than 3 minutes."
            ]
        },
        "62_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Wait, there were fairies shooting like crazy back there",
                "How did I forgot!?"
            ]
        },
        "102_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You look like you're in a rush.",
                "Why that?"
            ]
        },
        "113_h1_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Lovely Death Walking the Night",
                "Corey Elwood"
            ]
        },
        "113_0": {
            "lines": [
                "There's about to be a blood moon.",
                "So I gotta beat whoever is causing it."
            ]
        },
        "114_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So confident.",
                "Pumpkin jack was hunting people like you some time ago."
            ]
        },
        "115_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That pumpkin?",
                "He Crashed into a tree, then his scythe fell into his head."
            ]
        },
        "116_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Are you sure you didn't just beat his ass?"
            ]
        },
        "117_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Probably."
            ]
        },
        "118_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Anyways, now that he's not in here",
                "I can do my poison feast without disturbance."
            ]
        },
        "119_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I really don't have time for that!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "1": {
        "60_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I shouldn't be losing my time around here."
            ]
        },
        "60_1": {
            "lines": [
                "Even if the paradise is truly horribly pretty."
            ]
        }
    },
    "10": {
        "60_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's so cold.",
                "I should've brought a coat with me..."
            ]
        },
        "61_0": {
            "lines": [
                "There was even a coat shop near the forest entrance!"
            ]
        },
        "101_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Did you really came here so late at night",
                "Without anything to fight the cold?"
            ]
        },
        "102_h1_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Sadistic Autumn Flower",
                "Corey Elwood"
            ]
        },
        "102_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Blood moons usually provoke high temperatures.",
                "So, I just assumed this was the case."
            ]
        },
        "103_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Cover yourself with bushes or petals",
                "It's an all natural coat."
            ]
        },
        "104_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I see",
                "so Can I borrow them?"
            ]
        },
        "105_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Borrow? Borrow what?",
            ]
        },
        "106_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Your petals.",
                "Since you claim they're soooooo good as a coat."
            ]
        },
        "107_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh these poisonus petals?",
                "they'll give you too many negative symptons! you'll want to die!"
            ]
        },
        "108_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That's good for me",
                "Sometimes poison is a good medicine."
            ]
        }
    },
    "11": {
        "60_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Now that I think about it..."
            ]
        },
        "60_1": {
            "lines": [
                "Who would use such depressed petals as a coat."
            ]
        }
    },
    "20": {
        "60_0": {
            "lines": [
                "How dark might this place be at all?"
            ]
        },
        "61_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I can see pretty well in here.",
                "Ah...The irony."
            ]
        },
        "101_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I knew it.",
                "Cats can see pretty well in the dark."
            ]
        },
        "103_h1_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Sadistic Autumn Flower",
                "Corey Elwood"
            ]
        },
        "102_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Since always!",
                "our vision is far superior than the one of any other loser."
            ]
        },
        "104_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'll note that."
            ]
        },
        "106_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Now that I think about it..",
                "Why are you too interested in all that?"
            ]
        },
        "107_0": {
            "lines": [
                "To get victims with ease right!?"
            ]
        },
        "109_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Gotta know your prey, ",
                "ya know."
            ]
        },
        "110_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I suppose."
            ]
        },
        "111_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Now I wonder...",
                "Could cats see in a poison shower?"
            ]
        },
        "112_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm pretty sure that yes."
            ]
        }
    },
    "21": {
        "60_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I could see in it."
            ]
        },
        "60_1": {
            "lines": [
                "Another reason why cats are superior",
                "for sure."
            ]
        }
    }
}